cad:0_8541813101494801
    a cad:Note;
    rdfs:comment
        """This CAD diagram shows you how to propose and submit new classes
and properties to the upstream D3FEND ontology, accessible here:

    https://github.com/d3fend/d3fend-ontology


This syntax:

    :WebApplication

indicates that we are adding a new class to the ontology. Note the colon
character and lack of spaces. Also, this proposal fits :WebApplication
into the existing ontology as a subclass of d3f:ServiceApplication.


Thus, the Node will be interpreted as a class instead of an instance.

The same works for properties as well, note the
:has-payload property.



You can click "Save As" > "D3FEND Extension" and submit the file to the
D3FEND team for consideration.""";
    rdfs:label "Proposed Additions to D3FEND".
